                     <h2>Athletics </h2>
                     			
                     <p class="intro"><span>Visit our <a href="https://www.uscunionathletics.com">Bantam Athletics</a> website!</span></p>
                     
                     <p class="intro"><span>Athletics are a big part of college life, whether you experience them as an athlete
                           or a fan. At USC Union, we’re proud supporters of our Bantams and look forward to
                           students getting involved with athletics. <a href="https://secure.touchnet.net/C21544_ustores/web/product_detail.jsp?PRODUCTID=2807&amp;fbclid=IwAR3Y-DmCGvMbDQyUw4-HvBgMAh_snwmAYzFeHtKG9_x5tV4VYrjZj7UUiaE">Support the Bantam Athletics</a> to help the program continue to grow! <br></span></p>
                     
                     		
