                                    <div>Head Coach:&nbsp;</div>
                                    
                                    <div><a href="https://www.facebook.com/uscunioncrosscountry"><span>Facebook</span></a></div>
                                    
                                    <div><a href="https://www.instagram.com/uscunion.crosscountry"><span>Instagram</span></a></div>
                                    </div><button class="accordion-summary js-tab-target"><span>E-Sports Gaming (Club)</span></button><div class="accordion-details">
                                    
                                    <div>Head Coach: <a href="/about/system_and_campuses/union/faculty-staff/smith_brian.php">Brian Smith</a></div>
                                    
                                    <div style="padding-left: 40px;">Office: (864) 424-8077</div>
                                    </div>
                              </section>
                              
                              <h3>Our Teams</h3>
                              
                              <p>USC Union Bantam Athletics is committed to fostering academic and athletic achievement
                                 that will enable players to attain success on the field and in their future careers.</p>
                              
                              <p>The athletic department has expanded to include men’s soccer, women's soccer, men’s
                                 baseball, men's golf, &nbsp;women's volleyball, and women’s softball. These teams compete
                                 in the National Junior College Athletic Association. A bass fishing team, cross country
                                 team, and E-Sport Gaming have been added and they compete in the club level.</p>
                              
                              <hr>
                              
                              <h3>Home Field Map Links:</h3>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/131+N+Main+St,+Jonesville,+SC+29353/@34.837089,-81.6837417,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x8857af5188e92861:0xea5c55d028aea804!8m2!3d34.837089!4d-81.681553">Men &amp; Women's Soccer - Home field located behind Jonesville Town Hall</a>:</div>
                              
                              <div style="padding-left: 30px;">131 N Main St, Jonesville SC</div>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/@34.7133925,-81.630716,3a,75y,188.78h,67.65t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1s5Bm3w_0-d05mFwiPEKaxGQ!2e0!7i13312!8i6656">Women's Softball -&nbsp;The Coop located on Main Street</a>:&nbsp;</div>
                              
                              <div style="padding-left: 30px;">615 W Main St, Union SC</div>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ballpark+St,+Jonesville,+SC+29353/@34.833185,-81.688541,234m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m5!3m4!1s0x8857af570bf705b9:0x803e3fb61b20ffd3!8m2!3d34.8333816!4d-81.6881521">Men's Baseball -&nbsp;Home Field located in Jonesville</a>:</div>
                              
                              <div style="padding-left: 30px;">302 Ballpark Street, Jonesville SC</div>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Truluck+Gym/@34.7164192,-81.6204649,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0xe71b286efc52d80f!8m2!3d34.7163182!4d-81.6204345">Women's Volleyball - USC Union's Truluck Gym:</a></div>
                              
                              <div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;103 N Church St, Union SC</div>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/SCVu1derN7nGqNsi8">Men's Golf - USC Union Laurens Location</a>:</div>
                              
                              <div style="padding-left: 40px;">600 Peachtree Street, Clinton SC&nbsp;</div>
                              
                              <div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/600+Peachtree+St,+Clinton,+SC+29325/@34.4664362,-81.8990914,1141m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x8857e9b22b976e15:0xebedce88b31fcb90!8m2!3d34.4664362!4d-81.8965165!16s%2Fg%2F11b8v71191?coh=219816&amp;entry=tts&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI0MDgxMi4wKgBIAVAD">Cross Country - USC Union Laurens Location:</a></div>
                              
                              <div style="padding-left: 40px;">600 Peachtree Street, Clinton SC</div>
                              
                              <hr>
                              
                              <h3>Support Bantam Athletics</h3>
                              
                              <p>We have a&nbsp;Bantam Athletic sponsorship package with various levels. For more information,
                                 please contact Annie Smith at (864) 424-8055 or via email at <a href="mailto:alsmith@mailbox.sc.edu">alsmith@mailbox.sc.edu</a></p>
                              
                              		</div>
